            "review_title": "Review at Bò Né Bà Nũi",
            "review_text": "Vy H.\nWashington DC, District of Columbia7185 contributions\n0\nLunch in Ho Chi Minh City, VN\nDec 2025 • Family\nBò Né here is so delicious!! Highly recommend getting the Bò Né + Trứng + Pate + Xúc Xích (beef, egg, pate & sausage) to try everything. Everything is well flavored and huge portion. The Bánh Mì (bread) is crispy yet fluffy inside, so good!\n\nNothing fancy about this place, you sit in little stools low to the ground—but this place is popping!\nRead more\nWritten December 23, 2025",
